#       Run the following commands to restore secure permissions (755):
#       chmod -R 755 ${ZSH_CUSTOM:-~/.oh-my-zsh/custom}/plugins
#       compaudit | xargs chmod g-w,o-w 2>/dev/null
#   - Rebuild Completion Cache (If newly installed commands do not autocomplete):
